  Yes.  Go for Magicbane if artifact wishing isn't a problem.  After
all, wielding Magicbane gives Magic Resistance, one of the big three
mentioned above.  In addition to Elbereth, it has some interesting 
effects, and has +3 to hit (on top of an athame's intrinsic +2 to 
hit when wielded) and roughly +4.5 damage.

  Even if you wield another weapon for most of the game, Magicbane
should be wielded during most of the Ascension Run.  You should be 
running, not fighting.
 
