  You are mostly correct.  However, the chance to #twoweapon Grayswandir 
and a silver saber should not be passed up by anyone.  (Well - except 
for those classes that would have to poly into a marilith to twoweapon.)

  GS + SS is the ultimate cuisinart: slice and dice.  Even at basic 
skill that total +21 average extra silver damage against silver haters
is monstrous.  Add in the extra +11.5 of a +7 Grayswandir and you're
talking serious damage.

